        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 1:6",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "We have dealt very corruptly against thee, and have not kept the commandments, nor the statutes, nor the judgments, which thou commandedst thy servant Moses.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 1:7",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Remember, I beseech thee, the word that thou commandedst thy servant Moses, saying, If ye transgress, I will scatter you abroad among the nations:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 109,
            "end": 116,
            "text": "1 Ne. 22:3 (3–5); 2 Ne. 25:15 (14–16); D&C 45:19 (16–25)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 86
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 1:8",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "But if ye turn unto me, and keep my commandments, and do them; though there were of you cast out unto the uttermost part of the heaven, yet will I gather them from thence, and will bring them unto the place that I have chosen to set my name there.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 147,
            "end": 153,
            "text": "Deut. 30:3 (1–5); Micah 7:12 (11–12); 1 Ne. 22:12 (10–12); 2 Ne. 21:12 (11–16); D&C 45:25 (24–25)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 6
          },
          {
            "start": 136,
            "end": 139
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Nehemiah 1:9",
        "book": "Nehemiah",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Now these are thy servants and thy people, whom thou hast redeemed by thy great power, and by thy strong hand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "Ex. 33:13; 2 Ne. 29:4; D&C 86:11; 109:59 (59–67)."
